WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
There is no need to think about work and interpersonal matters in the future

2
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,140
such a life

3
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:35,380
Zhang Yi is even happier than before the end of the world

4
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:38,260
The roads outside are now blocked by heavy snow.

5
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,820
Come out later with tools and help clear the snow.

6
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,260
Three meters of heavy snow

7
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:45,340
It is almost impossible to rely on manpower to sweep out

8
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,740
This snow will last at least three more months

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:50,420
Now when I go out to clear the snow, it doesn’t fall as fast as it does.

10
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,460
Such cold weather

11
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,380
After I went out for a while, I turned into a popsicle.

12
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:54,660
Even if you clear the snow

13
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:58,260
I should wait until the snow stops before saying yes.

14
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:00,100
It's over seventy degrees below zero outside

15
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,100
I'll probably get injured if I go out for a while.

16
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,700
There is no decent cold equipment at all

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,900
How to get out
